# The Uptime Kuma stack (S6-2) needs no runtime secrets: monitors, notification
# channels, the admin account and the public status page are all configured in
# its web UI on first run and persisted in the `uptime-kuma-data` volume.
#
# This file exists only to mirror the other stacks' layout and to hold optional
# tuning if it is ever needed. Copy to `.env` next to docker-compose.yml on the
# server only if you set any of the below; otherwise no `.env` is required.
# See docs/operations/error-monitoring.md.

# Optional: override the container's internal port (rarely needed; the loopback
# publish in docker-compose.yml already maps 127.0.0.1:3004 -> 3001).
# UPTIME_KUMA_PORT=3001
